            <title xml:id="title_4688caa0" xml:lang="da">Den Miskundelige</title>
            <title type="alternative" xml:id="title_ed79e827" xml:lang="da">Til Himlene rækker din Miskundhed, Gud</title>
            <contributor xml:id="respStmt_N203AF">
               <persName role="composer" xml:id="persName_5808b750">J.P.E. Hartmann</persName>
               <persName role="author" xml:id="persName_8e5890ab">B.S. Ingemann</persName>
            </contributor>
            <creation xml:id="creation_0229e397">
               <date isodate="1852" xml:id="date_N203BC">1852</date>
            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_3869deb5">
               <p xml:id="idm192">When A.P. Berggreen published his "Melodier til den af Roeskilde-Præsteconvent udgivne Psalmebog" in 1853, he kept some of the most loved old chorales; however; he also asked some of his organist colleagues, among others Hartmann, to write some more appropriate tunes. His contributions were:  "Giv jeg, o Herre, følger dig" (HartW 234), "Stor er du, Gud!" (HartW 235); and the present hymn.</p>
            </history>
